    "features": "<p>Spies serving the Laconian agenda help to secure the empire and lay a path for its expansion. During the Transport Union era, this means collecting useful intelligence about the colonies, the Union, and Sol system. After the Laconian invasion, agents also work to uncover anyone working against the empire’s interests and bring them to justice—even if that means other Laconians who fail to uphold the high consul’s vision.</p><p><strong>Favored Stunts:</strong> Cover Your Tracks, Disarm, Take Cover</p><p><strong>Talents:</strong> Hacking (Expert), Observation (Novice) Misdirection (Expert)</p><p><strong>Equipment:</strong> pistol, stun gun, various tool kits and covert gear</p><p><strong>Armor + Toughness:</strong> 2</p>",
